# Keep the build context small and keep secrets out of image layers.
node_modules
dist
tests
vitest.config.ts
vitest.perf.config.ts
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
coverage
.DS_Store

# The demo dataset never ships.
#
# `prisma/` is copied wholesale so migrations and `seed.ts` are available on the
# box — DEPLOY.md has an optional "seed a demo studio" step that needs it. That
# is fine for seed.ts, which creates ONE studio and destroys nothing.
#
# demo.ts is a different animal: it deletes five studios by slug and rebuilds
# them. It shipped in the production image on 2026-08-25 with a guard that did
# not work (it allowlisted `postgres` as a local-looking host, which is exactly
# what the deployed database is called). The guard is fixed, but the better
# answer is that the file should not be there to guard.
prisma/demo.ts
